name: Sprott N
family: Flows
desc: One of J. C. Sprott's 19 simplest chaotic flows (case N) — five terms, one or two nonlinearities.
ref: J. C. Sprott, "Some simple chaotic flows", Phys. Rev. E 50 (1994)
tags: flow, sprott, 3d
dt: 0.02
ic: 0.1 0.1 0.1
camera: 25 20 0 1

param a = 2.0 [1, 3]
param b = 2.0 [1, 3]

dx = -a*y
dy = x + z^2
dz = 1 + y - b*z
